---
import { FOOTER_NAV, SITE } from '../data/site';
const year = 2026;
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-line bg-ink-950 text-ink-300">
  <div class="wrap py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="grid h-10 w-10 flex-none place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white/10" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <rect x="2.5" y="11" width="3.2" height="6.5" rx="1.2" fill="#6180FB" />
              <rect x="8.4" y="7" width="3.2" height="10.5" rx="1.2" fill="#94ACFF" />
              <rect x="14.3" y="2.5" width="3.2" height="15" rx="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
            Kallus Strategic Management
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-400">
          Clarity before capital. Strategy before financing. Understand the complete financial picture
          before the next move.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-2">
          <a
            href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
            class="block text-[0.9375rem] font-medium text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-white break-address"
            data-ev="email_click">{SITE.email}</a
          >
          <a
            href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`}
            class="block text-[0.9375rem] font-medium text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-white"
            data-ev="phone_click">{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      {
        FOOTER_NAV.map((col) => (
          <div>
            <h3 class="label text-ink-500">{col.title}</h3>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              {col.links.map((l) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={l.href} class="text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-300 transition-colors hover:text-white">
                    {l.label}
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-400">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-300">Important disclosures.</strong>
        Kallus Strategic Management is a financial strategy consulting practice. KSM is not a lender, a
        bank, a credit repair organization, a debt settlement or debt relief company, a credit reporting
        agency, a mortgage broker, or a registered investment adviser. KSM does not originate loans,
        submit financing applications on a client's behalf, or receive compensation from lenders.
      </p>
      <p>
        KSM does not guarantee financing approval, interest rates, credit limits, credit score changes,
        savings, or any other financial outcome. Approval decisions are made solely by lenders according
        to their own underwriting criteria. Any profile score, metric, roadmap or report shown on this
        website is an illustrative example created for demonstration and does not represent an actual
        client, an actual result, or a universal credit score.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website constitutes legal, tax, accounting or investment advice. Consult a
        qualified professional regarding your specific circumstances.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} Kallus Strategic Management. All rights reserved.</p>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2" aria-label="Legal">
        <a href="/privacy" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Terms of Use</a>
        <a href="/disclosures" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">Disclosures</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
